\def\@LN@column{1}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Implemented MA-SQLGrid{} information flow and candidate lifecycle. \textbf  {(a)} The Query Analyst and Schema Cartographer post question and schema records to an append-only blackboard, and the SQL Synthesizer packages externally supplied candidates. The Validation Engine records read-only execution evidence, while the Metamorphic-State Critic records named-state evidence when required. \textbf  {(b)} Hard eligibility gates precede the effective evidence score $e(y)=10I_{\mathrm  {shape}}+5I_{\mathrm  {order}}+5V$, $V\in [0,1]$, and the deterministic tie or abstention rule. Gold or reference results are loaded only after the decision and board digest are sealed. User authorization and operational approval remain outside the software boundary.}}{9}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:coordination}{{1}{9}{Implemented \masql {} information flow and candidate lifecycle. \textbf {(a)} The Query Analyst and Schema Cartographer post question and schema records to an append-only blackboard, and the SQL Synthesizer packages externally supplied candidates. The Validation Engine records read-only execution evidence, while the Metamorphic-State Critic records named-state evidence when required. \textbf {(b)} Hard eligibility gates precede the effective evidence score $e(y)=10I_{\mathrm {shape}}+5I_{\mathrm {order}}+5V$, $V\in [0,1]$, and the deterministic tie or abstention rule. Gold or reference results are loaded only after the decision and board digest are sealed. User authorization and operational approval remain outside the software boundary}{figure.caption.4}{}}
\newlabel{fig:coordination@cref}{{[figure][1][]1}{[1][8][]9}{}{}{}}
